{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2022-10-27 09:44:00', 'title': 'METEOROLOGICAL SERVICE SINGAPORE ADVANCES WEATHER FORECASTING WITH NEW SUPERCOMPUTER FROM HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE', 'text': 'SINGAPORE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BUILT A NEW SUPERCOMPUTER FOR THE METEOROLOGICAL SERVICE SINGAPORE (MSS) TO ADVANCE WEATHER FORECASTING AND TROPICAL CLIMATE RESEARCH FOR SINGAPORE AND THE BROADER SOUTHEAST ASIA REGION.'}